DE,Demo graphics
PN,10400
SC,0000
FL,100,101,102,103,100,100
OL,1,\x8D\x86GRAPHICS
OL,3,\x87Block graphics are a 2x3 grid per
OL,4,\x87cell - 80 by 72 pixels a page.
OL,7,\x97 !"#$%&'()*+,-./0123456789:;<=>?
OL,8,\x92 !"#$%&'()*+,-./0123456789:;<=>?
OL,9,\x96 !"#$%&'()*+,-./0123456789:;<=>?
OL,11,\x87Every pattern in order. On a
OL,12,\x87teletext session these are real
OL,13,\x87sextants. On an ANSI one they are
OL,14,\x87an ASCII density instead.
